            "review_title": "Review at Ommi Chay",
            "review_text": "Nicolas_122014\nParis, France5 contributions\n0\nVegetarian restaurant - delicious - genuine - eye-catching\nMar 2024 • Friends\nThe vegetarian restaurant's space is extremely lovely. Nice gentle music. Parking is comfortable. The menu is diverse with dishes from natural vegetables and vegetarian dishes in a modern and boring style. Beautifully presented dishes, lovely friendly staff, reasonable prices around 200k/person. I also received super delicious Hibiscus Tea. Will definitely come back.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten March 17, 2024",
